  mod_import_err_cycle.pcpp - Module: an import cycle

  Break step of mod_import: this exe imports fixtures\mod_import_err_cycle_a,
  which imports mod_import_err_cycle_b, which imports mod_import_err_cycle_a
  again. The cycle is reported at that name, in mod_import_err_cycle_b
  (its marker is there).
*******************************************************************************/

module exe mod_import_err_cycle;

/*
  @@test
